        <name>rbusTableRemoveRowHandler_t</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A table row remove callback handler. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>A provider must implement this handler to allow rows to be removed from a table. The rowName parameter will be a fully qualified name, specifying either the row&apos;s instance number (e.g. &quot;Device.IP.Interface.1&quot;) or the row&apos;s alias (e.g. &quot;Device.IP.Interface.[lan1]&quot;). <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
